  "details": "Description\n\nWhen opening the search input console over the search screen, clicking the X button to close the input dialog instead closes the entire search interface, making recommended/search term suggestions inaccessible.\n\nReproduction Steps\n\n1. Open World Search or Avatar Search menu\n\n2. Notice recommended search terms displayed in background\n\n3. Click on search input to open the input console overlay\n\n4. Click the X button on the input console to dismiss it\n\n5. Observe that entire search menu closes instead of just the input dialog\n\nDetails\n\n- Category: User Interface\n\n- Frequency: Always\n\n---\n\nplatform: PC (platform: Windows, store: Steam, headset: None)\n\nrawPlatform: WindowsPlayer\n\nclientVersion: 2026.3.2p2-1903-5de5614b49-Release\n\nunityVersion: 2022.3.22f2-DWR\n\nIn-Client Report\n\n---\n\n**Log file:** [output_log_2026-09-20_18-03-14.txt](https://api.vrchat.cloud/api/1/file/file_eba25ed7-6b87-46ea-904b-2c04e667cd0a/1/file)",
